### [[/ability/rule-ratannia]]((Rule, Ratannia!))
- Rule, Ratannia! - Cooldown increased from 130 to 160
- Rule, Ratannia! - Damage Reduction reduced from 20% to 15%
- Rule, Ratannia! - Radius reduced from 24m to 20m
- Rule, Ratannia! - Charge Duration reduced from 12s to 10s
- Rule, Ratannia! - Bonus Move speed no longer scales with Spirit
- Rule, Ratannia! - Now falls faster while charging
- Rule, Ratannia! - T1 +1m/s Move Speed to +2m/s Move Speed
- Rule, Ratannia! - T1 No longer gives -20s cooldown (Total cooldown from 110s to 160s)
- Rule, Ratannia! - T2 No longer grants +8s Charge Duration (Total charge duration from 20s to 10s)
- Rule, Ratannia! - T2 Flag Duration reduced from +8s to +5s
- Rule, Ratannia! - T3 Damage Reduction reduced from 15% to 10% (Total Damage Reduction from 35% to 25%)
==
